Output installation.gif

Set Theme "WildCherry"
Set FontSize 23
Set Width 1280
Set Height 730

Hide
Type "cd .."
Enter
Show

Type "go build -o RosewaterCLI ."
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "./RosewaterCLI"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 5s

Hide
Type "exit"
Enter
Type "rm -f RosewaterCLI"
Enter
Type "mv installation.gif Demos/"
Enter
Show
